- edge_face_intersection.rs: Newton-based edge-face piercing detection.
- face_splitter.rs: 2D parameter-space face splitting with signed area.

API additions:
- subtract(solid0, solid1, tol): A - B = A ∩ ¬B
- parametric::{parametric_intersection_curves, edge_face_intersections,
  split_face_by_curves, SSIConfig}

JSON comparison test framework (tests/boolean_comparison.rs):
- BooleanTestCase/BooleanTestResult serde structs for mesh vs parametric
